", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jkQRTZ1GJ0Q7kNvwHR_NQN&_nc_oc=Adr9aVuQFWn01refZHeuGd3_oZNam3p76IH74yZNbISiONIoduVaSs3YTu8U4DrS5_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5yqP45UXpPvTRB49jCDW_ZjPdhV7PCo8i_qdTLfclX9g&oe=6A1450F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dkCrGgd1ZUsQ7kNvwExbbcl&_nc_oc=AdrTU6dBMgc5RsIKf9trN0i5WACkvaQC8CGFjVcRc2Puv5c7mFXajUPqqx1IaKhK5m8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4yi1IBH2OzHUzkL09E_mWjXGsGuGm1WYRW38tSowGgBg&oe=6A1467CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nOosAIi8KO8Q7kNvwGpZuZ6&_nc_oc=Adq6Pye05RGRIGYVkB8GdJFGZ0gQVa3FqtsxAIcZ-gYThK801Fg5k1Z3YBewLl6w9tY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7naN2JWQqKJjIPyJ45lCqYoGoRQNcUyf2BLLN9Mx16fA&oe=6A14664E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel